    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (analyse study examine canvass)
  entry
    definition "make a mathematical, chemical, or grammatical analysis of; break down into components or essential features"
    examples ("analyze a specimen" "analyze a sentence" "analyze a chemical compound")
    id oewn-00645135-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (analyse "break down" dissect "take apart")
  entry
